The licence of the transcendental functions in `src/ieee754.rs`.

The file is translated from V8's `src/base/ieee754.cc`, version 12.0.267.10,
which is itself adapted from fdlibm by Sun Microsystems. The C++ is kept
alongside it, in `scripts/ieee754.cc`, and the translation script,
`scripts/translate_ieee754.py`, reads that file and writes the Rust.

The notice the C++ carries is this:

    The following is adapted from fdlibm (http://www.netlib.org/fdlibm).

    ====================================================
    Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun Microsystems, Inc. All rights reserved.

    Developed at SunSoft, a Sun Microsystems, Inc. business.
    Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this
    software is freely granted, provided that this notice
    is preserved.
    ====================================================

    The original source code covered by the above license above has been
    modified significantly by Google Inc.
    Copyright 2016 the V8 project authors. All rights reserved.

The conditions of that notice are kept: the notice is preserved, in this
file and at the head of the C++ it was translated from.

V8 is a project of Google LLC and is published under the BSD three-clause
licence. The licence of the d3 packages this crate is a port of is in
`LICENSE.d3-packages`, and the licence of the crate itself is in `LICENSE`.
